  "solution": {
    "text": "Hint: \\(\\underset{\\downarrow \\atop \\large \\text{discontinuous}}{\\left[x^2\\right]} \\sin \\pi x\\)\nat all points where \\(x^2\\) is integer\nIf \\(x^2\\) is integer and \\(x\\) is also integer then \\(f(x)\\) will be continuous, but if \\(x^2\\) is integer and \\(x\\) is not integer then \\(f(x)\\) will be discontinuous.",
